  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut potato into bite-sized chunks. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water. Set aside.\n• Place potato on the lined oven tray. Sprinkle with garlic seasoning. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt.\n• Toss to coat, spread out evenly and roast until tender, 20-25 mins. Set aside to cool.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/641ce221246dcfc946049578/step-0ac7e2b4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice brown onion.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion, stirring until softened, 5-6 mins.\n• Reduce heat to medium and add the balsamic vinegar, the water and brown sugar. Cook, until sticky, 3-5 mins. Transfer to a small bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/641ce221246dcfc946049578/step-8f6dd75c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato and cucumber. Drain haloumi and pat dry.\n• Wipe out pan and return to medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side. Transfer to a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/641ce221246dcfc946049578/step-0db4e988.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine tomato, cucumber, potato, salad leaves, and a drizzle of balsamic vinegar and olive oil.\n• Toss to coat and season to taste.\n• Divide salad between plates.\n• Top with caramelised onion and haloumi.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/641ce221246dcfc946049578/step-8cf244d1.jpg"
    }
  ]
